# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"That was just a single feature of a single data vector. When encoding $N$ "
"features into the rotation angles of $n$ qubits, say for the $j^\\text{th}$ "
"data vector $\\vec{x}^{(j)} = (x_1,...,x_N),$ the encoded product state will"
" look like this:\n"
msgstr ""
"Eso fue solo una característica de un único vector de datos. Cuando se "
"codifican $N$ características en los ángulos de rotación de $n$ qubits, "
"digamos para el $j^\\text{mo}$ vector de datos $\\vec{x}^{(j)} = "
"(x_1,...,x_N),$ el estado producto codificado tendrá este aspecto:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\vec{x}^{(j)}\\rangle = \\bigotimes^N_{k=1} \\cos(\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k)|0\\rangle + \\sin(\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k)|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\vec{x}^{(j)}\\rangle = \\bigotimes^N_{k=1} \\cos(\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k)|0\\rangle + \\sin(\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k)|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We note that this is equivalent to\n"
msgstr "Notamos que esto es equivalente a\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\vec{x}^{(j)}\\rangle = \\bigotimes^N_{k=1} R_Y(2\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k)|0\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\vec{x}^{(j)}\\rangle = \\bigotimes^N_{k=1} R_Y(2\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k)|0\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

