msgid ""
"By default in Qiskit, the features $(\\vec{x}_1, \\vec{x}_2)$ are mapped "
"together to $R_{ZZ}(\\theta)$ by this mapping function $\\theta_{1,2} = "
"\\phi(\\vec{x}_1, \\vec{x}_2) = 2(\\pi-\\vec{x}_1)(\\pi-\\vec{x}_2)$. Qiskit"
" allows the user to customize the function $\\phi$ (or $\\phi_S$ where $S$ "
